Hello Ted,

It activates the super page feature of Alpha processor.
(It was known as the page granularity hint support patch, but
the super page is lucid for the people. )

When activated, the kernel will run up to 5 times faster
on a large matrix transpose benchmark. The performance
advantage is from fewer page table entries and thus fewer
translation buffer misses.

I hope this helps.

Best Regards,


--George


